{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1387", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mayilai_seeni_venkatasamy", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "journal_contributions", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமியின் கட்டுரைகள் தொடக்கக் காலத்தில் பெருமளவில் வெளிவந்த வரலாற்று மற்றும் இலக்கிய இதழ்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுதேசமித்திரன், ஆனந்த விகடன்", "B": "குயில், முல்லை", "C": "செந்தமிழ்ச் செல்வி, தமிழ்ப்பொழில், லஷ்மி", "D": "மணிக்கொடி, எழுத்து"}, "explanation": "செந்தமிழ்ச் செல்வி, கரந்தைத் தமிழ்ச் சங்கத்தின் 'தமிழ்ப்பொழில்', 'லஷ்மி' முதலான புகழ்மிக்க இதழ்களில் இவரது அரிய ஆய்வுக் கட்டுரைகள் வெளிவந்தன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which pioneering literary journals were Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy's scholarly articles extensively published?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Swadesamitran, Ananda Vikatan", "B": "Kuyil, Mullai", "C": "Senthamizh Selvi, Thamizhppozhil, and Lakshmi", "D": "Manikkodi, Ezhuthu"}, "explanation": "His landmark research papers were published in 'Senthamizh Selvi', 'Thamizhppozhil', and 'Lakshmi'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class":