{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1389", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mayilai_seeni_venkatasamy", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "christianity_islam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘கிறித்தவமும் தமிழும்’, ‘இசுலாமும் தமிழும்’ ஆகிய நூல்களையும் எழுதிய பெருமைக்குரிய தமிழறிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி", "B": "கா. சுப்பிரமணிய பிள்ளை", "C": "திரு. வி. கலியாணசுந்தரனார்", "D": "தேவநேயப் பாவாணர்"}, "explanation": "பௌத்தம், சமணம் மட்டுமன்றி 'கிறித்தவமும் தமிழும்', 'இசுலாமும் தமிழும்' என்ற நூல்களையும் எழுதிச் சமய நல்லிணக்க ஆய்வு முன்னோடியாகத் திகழ்ந்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who was the versatile scholar who authored 'Christianity and Tamil' and 'Islam and Tamil' demonstrating interfaith historical research?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy", "B": "K. Subramania Pillai", "C": "Thiru. Vi. Kalyanasundaranar", "D": "Devaneyap Pavanar"}, "explanation": "In addition to Buddhism and Jainism, he also authored 'Christianity and Tamil' and 'Islam and Tamil'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_yea