{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1398", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mayilai_seeni_venkatasamy", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "summary_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘நமது அடையாளங்களை மீட்டவர்’ என்று 12-ஆம் வகுப்பு உரைநடைப் பகுதி யாரைக் குறிப்பிடுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திருவள்ளுவர்", "B": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி", "C": "பாரதியார்", "D": "காமராசர்"}, "explanation": "12-ஆம் வகுப்பு பொதுத்தமிழ் இயல் 8-இன் முதல் உரைநடைப் பாடம் மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி அவர்களைக் குறித்தே 'நமது அடையாளங்களை மீட்டவர்' என்ற தலைப்பில் அமைந்துள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whom does the Unit 8 Class 12 Tamil prose lesson title 'Namadhu Adaiyaalangalai Meettavar' directly refer to?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thiruvalluvar", "B": "Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy", "C": "Bharathiyar", "D": "Kamarajar"}, "explanation": "The lesson explicitly commemorates the lifelong monumental scholarship of Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 192, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Ta