{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1444", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "sirubanaatruppadai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_vallal_mountains", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (வள்ளல்கள் - ஆட்சி செய்த மலை/நாடு):\n(1) பேகன் - (i) பறம்பு மலை\n(2) பாரி - (ii) பொதினி (பழனி மலை)\n(3) ஆய் - (iii) கொல்லி மலை\n(4) ஓரி - (iv) பொதிய மலை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iii)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "பேகன் = பொதினி (பழனி); பாரி = பறம்பு மலை; ஆய் = பொதிய மலை; ஓரி = கொல்லி மலை. சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the following (Sangam Philanthropists - Ruled Mountains/Regions):\n(1) Pegan - (i) Parambu hills\n(2) Pari - (ii) Pothini (Palani hills)\n(3) Aay - (iii) Kolli hills\n(4) Oari - (iv) Pothigai hills", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iii)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Pegan = Palani; Pari = Parambu; Aay = Pothigai; Oari = Kolli. Correct match: D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "nega