{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1486", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "kuriyeedu_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "symbol_movement_france", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘குறியீட்டியம்’ (Symbolism) என்னும் இலக்கிய இயக்கம் 19-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டின் இறுதியில் எந்த நாட்டில் முதன்முதலில் தோன்றியது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இங்கிலாந்து", "B": "பிரான்சு (France)", "C": "ஜெர்மனி", "D": "அமெரிக்கா"}, "explanation": "குறியீட்டிய இயக்கம் பிரான்சு நாட்டில் போத்லேர் (Baudelaire), மல்லார்மே (Mallarme), வெர்லேன் (Verlaine) முதலான கவிஞர்களால் தோற்றுவிக்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which country did the literary movement 'Symbolism' originate during the late 19th century?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "England", "B": "France", "C": "Germany", "D": "United States"}, "explanation": "The Symbolist movement originated in France led by avant-garde poets like Baudelaire, Mallarme, and Verlaine."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 209, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 