{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1501", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "kuriyeedu_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "darkness_symbol", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கியங்களில் ‘இருள்’ எவற்றிற்கான பொதுவான குறியீடாக ஆளப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அறியாமை, துன்பம், அடிமைத்தனம் மற்றும் தீமை", "B": "மகிழ்ச்சி மற்றும் பெருஞ்செல்வம்", "C": "அறிவொளி மற்றும் ஞானம்", "D": "விவசாய செழிப்பு"}, "explanation": "இருள் என்பது எங்கும் மனிதர்களின் அறியாமை, துயரம், அடிமைத்தளை மற்றும் தீய சக்திகளுக்குக் குறியீடாகப் பயன்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Across classical and modern literature, what does 'Darkness' (Irul) universally symbolize?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ignorance, misery, political subjugation, and moral evil", "B": "Joy and opulent wealth", "C": "Enlightenment and divine wisdom", "D": "Agricultural fertility"}, "explanation": "Darkness archetypally represents moral evil, despair, ignorance, and oppression."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 210, "chapter": null, "section": null, "r