{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1521", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mozhippayirchi_iyal8", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "valimigum_idangal_athiyan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இயல் 8 மொழித்திறன் பயிற்சியின்படி, 'அகர, இகர ஈற்று வினையெச்சங்களின் பின் வல்லினம் மிகும்' என்பதற்குரிய சரியான சான்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாடக் கேட்டான் (அகர ஈற்று வினையெச்சம்)", "B": "வந்த பையன் (பெயரெச்சம்)", "C": "பெரிய குதிரை (குறிப்புப் பெயரெச்சம்)", "D": "வாழ்க பாரதம் (வியங்கோள் வினைமுற்று)"}, "explanation": "அகர ஈற்று வினையெச்சத்தின் பின் வல்லினம் மிகும் (பாட + கேட்டான் = பாடக் கேட்டான்). பெயரெச்சம், வியங்கோள் வினைமுற்று ஆகியவற்றின் பின் வல்லினம் மிகாது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Unit 8 grammar exercises, which option correctly exemplifies plosive doubling after an adverbial participle ending in short 'a' or 'i'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paadak keettaan (Adverbial participle ending in short 'a')", "B": "Vandha paiyan (Relative participle)", "C": "Periya kuthirai (Descriptive participle)", "D": "Vaazhga bharatham (Optative verb)"}, "explanation": "Plosives double following adverbial participles ending in 'a' (Paada + keettaan = Paadak keettaan)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 205, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 205", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 8", "Grammar", "Sandhi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1522", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mozhippayirchi_iyal8", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nool_aasi_matching_iyal8", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (நூல் - ஆசிரியர்):\n(1) சாசனச் செய்யுள் மஞ்சரி - (i) சுகந்தி சுப்பிரமணியன்\n(2) புதையுண்ட வாழ்க்கை - (ii) எச்.ஏ. கிருஷ்ணபிள்ளை\n(3) இரட்சணிய மனோகரம் - (iii) மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)", "D": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(i)"}, "explanation": "சாசனச் செய்யுள் மஞ்சரி = மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி; புதையுண்ட வாழ்க்கை = சுகந்தி சுப்பிரமணியன்; இரட்சணிய மனோகரம் = எச்.ஏ. கிருஷ்ணபிள்ளை. சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the following (Monograph/Collection - Author):\n(1) Sasana Seyyul Manjari - (i) Suganthi Subramanian\n(2) Pudhaiyunda Vaazhkkai - (ii) H.A. Krishna Pillai\n(3) Ratchanya Manoharam - (iii) Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)", "D": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Sasana Seyyul Manjari = Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy; Pudhaiyunda Vaazhkkai = Suganthi Subramanian; Ratchanya Manoharam = H.A. Krishna Pillai. Correct match: B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 213, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 213", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 8", "Literature", "Book Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1523", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mozhippayirchi_iyal8", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_kannottam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘கண்ணோட்டம் இல்லாத கண் என் செய்யும்?’ - இக்குறட்பாவில் ‘கண்ணோட்டம்’ என்பதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கண்களின் பார்வைத் திறன்", "B": "மருத்துவப் பரிசோதனை", "C": "இரக்கம் / பிறர் துன்பம் கண்டு உருகும் மனிதநேயப் பரிவு", "D": "கண்ணாடி அணிதல்"}, "explanation": "‘கண்ணோட்டம்’ என்பது பிறர் நிலை கண்டு இரங்கும் ஈரநெஞ்சமாகும். அத்தகைய இரக்கமற்ற கண்கள் புண்ணுக்கு நிகரானவை என வள்ளுவர் கூறுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the precise philosophical meaning of 'Kannottam' in Thirukkural?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Optical visual acuity", "B": "Ophthalmological screening", "C": "Empathetic compassion / Kindness melting at the distress of others", "D": "Wearing spectacles"}, "explanation": "'Kannottam' signifies tender-hearted compassion and benign consideration toward others."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2