{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1530", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mozhippayirchi_iyal8", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "porutpaal_thirukkural_iyal8", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அன்பு நாண் ஒப்புரவு கண்ணோட்டம் வாய்மையோடு ஐந்துசால்பு ஊன்றிய தூண்’ - இக்குறளில் சான்றாண்மைக்குத் தூணாகக் கூறப்படும் ஐந்தில் இடம்பெறாதது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நாண் (பழிக்கு நாணுதல்)", "B": "வீரம் (போர்க்களப் பெருமை)", "C": "ஒப்புரவு (உலக நடையறிந்து உதவுதல்)", "D": "கண்ணோட்டம் (இரக்கம்)"}, "explanation": "அன்பு, நாண், ஒப்புரவு, கண்ணோட்டம், வாய்மை ஆகிய ஐந்தே சால்பின் தூண்கள்; இதில் வீரம் கூறப்படவில்லை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kural outlining the five pillars supporting noble character (Saandraanmai), which of the following is NOT included?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sense of moral shame (Naan)", "B": "Martial valor in war (Veeram)", "C": "Beneficence to society (Oppuravu)", "D": "Compassion (Kannottam)"}, "explanation": "Valluvar names Love, Shame of guilt, Beneficence, Compassion, and Truthfulness. Battlefield valor is not among the five."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 212, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 212", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 8", "Literature", "Thirukkural Saandraanmai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1531", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mozhippayirchi_iyal8", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sangam_thinai_food_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (திணைகள் - சிறுபாணாற்றுப்படை காட்டும் உணவு முறை):\n(1) மருத நிலம் - (i) ஆமான் சூடும் புளிங்கூழும்\n(2) பாலை நிலம் - (ii) வெண்சோறும் மீன் கறியும்\n(3) நெய்தல் நிலம் - (iii) நெல்லஞ்சோறும் நண்டுக் கறியும்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(i)"}, "explanation": "மருதம் = நெல்லஞ்சோறும் நண்டுக் கறியும்; பாலை = சுட்ட இறைச்சியும் புளிங்கூழும்; நெய்தல் = வெண்சோறும் வறுத்த மீன் கறியும். சரியான பொருத்தம்: (1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Thinai ecosystems with the culinary hospitality portrayed in Sirubanaatruppadai:\n(1) Marutham - (i) Roasted game and tangy gruel\n(2) Paalai - (ii) White rice and fried sea fish\n(3) Neithal - (iii) Paddy rice and freshwater crab curry", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Marutham = rice and crab; Paalai = roast meat and gruel; Neithal = white rice and sea fish. Correct match: C."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_k